{
  "id": "719",
  "title": "Who Cooked the Fish?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-05-02",
  "synopsis": "Ben misunderstands Lili when she tries to introduce him to a delicious dish.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1037/82109dac21c0965b71b3d9944a845863b9b62bab.mp3?1556270612",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "水煮鱼\n\n丽丽：太好了！水煮鱼！\n本：不是我煮的。\n丽丽：本，你看你看！这是我很喜欢吃的菜！水煮鱼！\n本：我也不知道是谁煮的。\n丽丽：你在说什么？\n本：你不是问我“谁煮鱼”吗？我也不知道是谁煮的鱼。\n丽丽：本！我没有问你“是谁煮的鱼”，我说的是这个菜叫“水煮鱼”，“水”是“水果”的水。",
    "traditional": "水煮魚\n\n麗麗：太好了！水煮魚！\n本：不是我煮的。\n麗麗：本，你看你看！這是我很喜歡吃的菜！水煮魚！\n本：我也不知道是誰煮的。\n麗麗：你在說什麼？\n本：你不是問我“誰煮魚”嗎？我也不知道是誰煮的魚。\n麗麗：本！我沒有問你“是誰煮的魚”，我說的是這個菜叫“水煮魚”，“水”是“水果”的水。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fish Boiled in Water"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：太好了！水煮鱼！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：太好了！水煮魚！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tài hǎo le shuǐ zhǔ yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Very good! Fish boiled in water!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：不是我煮的。",
      "traditional": "本：不是我煮的。",
      "pinyin": "běn bú shì wǒ zhǔ de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I didn’t cook it."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，你看你看！这是我很喜欢吃的菜！水煮鱼！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，你看你看！這是我很喜歡吃的菜！水煮魚！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn nǐ kàn nǐ kàn zhè shì wǒ hěn xǐ huan chī de cài shuǐ zhǔ yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, look, look! This is a dish I really like to eat! Fish boiled in water!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：我也不知道是谁煮的。",
      "traditional": "本：我也不知道是誰煮的。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ yě bù zhī dào shì shéi zhǔ de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I don’t know who cooked it either."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你在说什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你在說什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ zài shuō shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: What are you saying?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：你不是问我“谁煮鱼”吗？我也不知道是谁煮的鱼。",
      "traditional": "本：你不是問我“誰煮魚”嗎？我也不知道是誰煮的魚。",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ bú shì wèn wǒ shéi zhǔ yú ma wǒ yě bù zhī dào shì shéi zhǔ de yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Didn’t you ask me “Who cooked the fish”? I don’t know who cooked the fish either."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本！我没有问你“是谁煮的鱼”，",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本！我沒有問你“是誰煮的魚”，",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn wǒ méi yǒu wèn nǐ shì shuí zhǔ de yú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "我说的是这个菜叫“水煮鱼”，“水”是“水果”的水。",
      "traditional": "我說的是這個菜叫“水煮魚”，“水”是“水果”的水。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ shuō de shì zhè ge cài jiào shuǐ zhǔ yú shuǐ shì shuǐ guǒ de shuǐ",
      "english": "Lili: Ben! I haven’t asked you “Who cooked this fish”."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What I said was this dish is called “fish boiled in water”. “Shui” is water from “shuiguo”."
    }
  ],
